    <h2>DQ's Only Dairy-Free Frozen Novelty</h2>
  <p>The Non-Dairy Dilly® Bar is Dairy Queen's most important product for guests who avoid dairy. It is the only frozen novelty bar on <a href="/">The Queen Dairy Menu</a> made without dairy ingredients — everything else (cones, sundaes, Blizzards, Buster Bars) contains dairy. At $2.49, it is just $0.50 more than the standard chocolate Dilly Bar.</p>

  <h2>Non-Dairy vs. Standard Dilly Bar</h2>
  <div class="table-wrap"><table class="size-table"><thead><tr><th>Option</th><th>Price</th><th>Calories</th><th>Key Difference</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Non-Dairy Dilly Bar</td><td class="price-cell">$2.49</td><td>220 cal</td><td>Dairy-free base, chocolatey coating — for dairy-free guests</td></tr><tr><td>Chocolate Dilly Bar</td><td class="price-cell">$1.99</td><td>210 cal</td><td>DQ soft serve (contains dairy), crispy chocolate shell</td></tr></tbody></table></div>

  <h2>Is the Non-Dairy Dilly Bar Vegan?</h2>
  <p>The Non-Dairy Dilly Bar is made without dairy ingredients, making it suitable for guests who are lactose intolerant or following a dairy-free diet. For strict vegans, note that the chocolatey coating and production environment should be verified with your specific DQ location — manufacturing processes and shared equipment vary. Contact your local DQ or check the DQ allergen guide before ordering for strict dietary requirements.</p>

  <h2>Where to Find It</h2>
  <p>The Non-Dairy Dilly Bar is available at all DQ locations — both Grill &amp; Chill and Treat-only locations. It is typically kept in the freezer alongside the standard Dilly Bars and other novelty bars. Unlike some DQ items that are Grill &amp; Chill only, the Non-Dairy Dilly Bar has broad availability.</p>

